# Frontend (CRA dev server) only. Not needed for a default local setup;
# uncomment for LAN access to `npm run dev` from another device.
# Server-side settings live in backend/.env (see backend/.env.example), and
# Docker uses .env.docker plus .env.db, the database password only (see README
# "Docker Setup" and .env.db.example).
# HOST=0.0.0.0
# DANGEROUSLY_DISABLE_HOST_CHECK=true
